# Build artefacts
/target/
**/target/

# Cargo lockfile policy:
#   For *binaries* / *firmware* the lockfile SHOULD be committed so builds
#   are reproducible bit-for-bit. ezal-firmware is the binary here, so we
#   keep Cargo.lock under version control. (It lives at the workspace root.)
# (No ignore entry for Cargo.lock — committed deliberately.)

# Editor backups and swap files
**/*.rs.bk
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# Nix / direnv
# `.envrc` is committed (it just says `use flake`); the local cache that
# direnv writes alongside it is not, and neither are `nix build` outputs.
.direnv/
result
result-*

# AI tooling
.antigravitycli/

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# probe-rs / cargo-flash artefacts
*.uf2
*.bin
*.hex

# defmt log dumps
*.defmt
